update parasite
[It's a journal. It's covered in stains... spaghetti sauce?]
[It reads the following text\:]
if {journal_2_read} == false:
	'Little one, I have graced you with your first meal.'
	'Eat well. Grow strong.'
	'You must gain strength for what is to come.'
	'Eat quickly, and waste not a single scrap.'
else:
	[style name="Style_Parasite_Red"]
	'You are presented with little food, brother.'
	'What will you do when you run out?'
	[style name="Style"]
if {pasta_eaten} == false:
	[By the journal, you find a dish of half-moldy pasta.]
	parasite: The host is weak. I must...
	[You eat it. Your host gags involuntarily.]
	[No matter. You know what's best for her.]
	set {pasta_eaten} = true
set {journal_2_read} = true